  "fixes": [
    "File-based online narration prepares up to two paragraphs before starting and waits at most 1.5 seconds for the second one after the first is ready. It retains the queue and plays ready paragraphs in order.",
    "A transient connection or HTTP 5xx/408 failure retries the same paragraph once; failure cannot silently skip a paragraph.",
    "Chapter layout completion signals readiness before the page stream closes. A promoted layout resumes narration once for its current reading session.",
    "Resume uses the current chapter, and the system speech service avoids stopping an already drained queue."
  ],
